{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261118/photo/bkn-20261118090402651-1118_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261118101517\"/><p>APEC工商領導人峰會開幕。</p><p>2026年亞太經合組織（APEC）工商領導人峰會周三（18日）於廣東深圳前海國際會議中心舉行開幕式，中國國家主席習近平發表主旨演講。</p><p>習近平在開幕式上發表主旨演講，呼籲攜手建設亞太共同體，促進亞太共同繁榮。今年是中國相隔12年再擔任APEC東道主，大會將以倡議形式提出成果，是峰會創辦30年來首次。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:24:22.495717+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T01:04:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:17:32.969342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:17:32.969342+00:00","content_hash":"b4c11732af0a21e652d6b67e3251528b16b0f9aa72fc3a27e9a94d062790198b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}